  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi></math> be any function continuous on <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and twice differentiable on <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> . If all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi></mi></math> , then for any <math><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>"
