  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&rsquo;s use LMVT for <math><mi>x</mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi></mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also use LMVT for <math><mi>x</mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi></mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi></mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is decreasing</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi></mi></math> ( <math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is increasing)</p>"
